=2 Notes
* Completing this mission grants access to the {p:Mog Locker}.
* Completing this mission grants access use the {p:Runic Portal}.
* Completing this mission grants access to {p:Assault}

=2 Walkthrough
* Take the {@k} {k:Supplies package} to any one of the {p:Staging Points} (with the exception of {p:Nyzul Isle Staging Point} and the {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} portal, {p:Chamber of Passage}), and talk to the NPC stationed there to complete delivery.
** Once you're at a staging point, be sure to **do the delivery first** to the nearby NPC, as interacting with the **Runic Portal** will teleport you directly back to {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}, and you will not be allowed to use the {p:Chamber of Passage} to return yet.
** Visit the {p:Staging Points page by clicking here|Staging Points} and then click on one of the **Runic Portal Names** for detailed steps on reaching one of these locations. You will eventually want them all, so pick any of them.
*** Note for returners and new players: there's now another quick way to initially get to Nashmau (without taking the {z:Ferry|Ferry - Nashmau/Al Zahbi} or navigating {p:Alzadaal teleporters|Nyzul Isle Staging Point}) via a {p:Voidwatch Warp} easily available to most players using the {z:Caedarva Mire} destination. (There's no easily unlockable Unity warp for that purpose!)
**** At H-10 in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} there's a tunnel on the first floor where you'll find an **Ironbound Gate**, which leads outside to {z:Wajaom Woodlands} **Postern** where you can talk to {n:Camille} to Participate in Voidwatch Ops. You don't need to have done any other part of Voidwatch at all - you just need to be level 75 and be Rank 3 in your home nation.
**** After receiving the {k:Amber stratum abyssite}, you can now use any {p:Atmacite Refiner} (in the Present) to warp to these locations initially to unlock other Home Points, Survival Guides, and Staging Points (hence the inclusion in this section!)... you'll just need 1000 {p:cruor|Cruor}.
**** If you don't have cruor from {p:Abyssea}, you can exchange 1 copper voucher from a {p:Sparks NPC|Category:Sparks Of Eminence Rewards} for the fee - and in {z:Southern San d'Oria} or {z:Bastok Markets} this is right next to the {p:Atmacite Refiner} at those locations.
**** And, from the {p:Atmacite Refiner}, do Request Teleportation -> Aht Urhgan. -> Caedarva Mire., and you'll be just outside the east entrance of {z:Nashmau}. Walk inside to grab the Survival Guide and the Home Point and continue your journey.
**** From here, the {z:Azouph Isle Staging Point} is **very close** with a mount. You can use either the east or north exit from {z:Nashmau} to get there.
* After you've delivered the {@k} {k:Supplies package} to the blue-clad Immortal NPC nearby, use the {p:Runic Portal} at the Staging Point to return to {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}.
* Speak to {p:Naja Salaheem}.

